  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rg2a](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rg2a) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 158.185 depth occurred on Oct 10 2025 Banda Sea. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -6.9375 longitude 129.544. It impacted 47 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
